 <metadata name="Description">&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;Easily collect your printer&amp;amp;#39;s purge waste with this compact, quick-release bucket.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;Designed for simplicity, performance and efficient printing.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;h3&amp;gt;Latest updates&amp;lt;/h3&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;🔄 Added print profile for X2D.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;🔄 Added print profiles for H Series (H2S, H2D, H2C).&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;🔄 improved clip with a bit more clearance for the screw.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;h3&amp;gt;Model features&amp;lt;/h3&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;✅ Fully 3D printed, no extra parts required (no magnets, no extra screws).&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;✅ Highly optimized for speed and efficiency.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;✅ No supports.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;</metadata>
